OL,3,GNEWSA200-year-old maternity register
OL,4,Aauctioned for #4.9k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA handwritten maternity register
OL,7,Frecording births in rural Oxfordshire
OL,8,Fhas sold for #4,900 at auction against
OL,9,Fan estimate of #200-#400.
OL,11,FThe register, dating from 1820 to 1830,
OL,12,Fdocuments childbirth and the medical
OL,13,Fcare available to rural communities,
OL,14,Foffering a glimpse into the lives of
OL,15,Fordinary people in the early 19th
OL,16,Fcentury,
OL,18,FIt records the names and addresses of
OL,19,Fpatients in villages including Hook
OL,20,FNorton, Epwell, Sibford Gower, Hornton
OL,21,Fand Shenington.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
