OL,4,Aauctioned for #4.9k
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was part of a collection of
OL,7,Fdocuments from a family of doctors,
OL,8,Fdiscovered in a Dorset loft during a
OL,9,Fhouse clearance, which sold for a total
OL,10,Fof #10,600.
